{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ3AevTPXsvKT3G5jgLe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**About 44.7% of Microsoft's full-time employees were outside the U.S. as of June 30, 2024.**\n\nThe FY2024 Form 10-K says that as of June 30, 2024, Microsoft \"employed approximately 228,000 people on a full-time basis, 126,000 in the U.S. and 102,000 internationally.\"\n\n- Total full-time employees: about 228,000\n- In the U.S.: about 126,000 (about 55.3%)\n- Outside the U.S.: about 102,000\n- Calculation: 102,000 ÷ 228,000 ≈ **44.7%**\n\nThe search tool doesn't show snippets of the filing text. So I checked this by searching for that exact sentence, and it matched only this 10-K. Because the filing rounds the headcounts, the percentage is approximate.\n\n**Sources**\n- Microsoft Corp. Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended June 30, 2024, filed 2024-07-30, accession 0000950170-24-087843 (msft-20240630.htm)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":632,"cache_read_input_tokens":6230,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":632},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"43ce4a19-7bd6-4732-a985-f0d3e18415b2","uuid":"dc332614-9d75-4968-9413-23476fc79c67","timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:12:01.221Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ3Aeg51tzD15rN6T2RT"}
